"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-18T11:46:00-07:00","id":1518261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shemihazazel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883338-the-other-five-paths-2e?p=1518252#post1518252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm going to take a stab at outlining the other 5 Dur-Abzu, to compliment those already outlined in NHNA. I'm running a heavily Abyss-flavored Chronicle, and would love to introduce a Nasnas Sophros. Thank you for all the amazing work you put into writing up these new Paths.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Existing Dur-Abzu:<br /> <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aos_S%C3%AD\" target=\"_blank\">Ao Si</a>, the Mound of Thorns</b>\u200b (Inversion of Arcadia)<br /> <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_Mesopotamian_underworld\" target=\"_blank\">Arallu</a>, the Cave of Rot and Tarnish</b> (Inversion of Stygia)\u200b<br /> <b><a href=\"https://books.google.com/books?id=N1EnBgAAQBAJ&amp;pg=PT169&amp;lpg=PT169&amp;dq=Drugaskan+(Zoroastrian)&amp;source=bl&amp;ots=Qd5xFk_i7Q&amp;sig=ACfU3U0Lvow1c_YFMr1JgTgPWymJt3iyZQ&amp;hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjG2Pn0va3rAhXGZs0KHfkPCSMQ6AEwEXoECAoQAQ#v=onepage&amp;q=Drugaskan%20(Zoroastrian)&amp;f=false\" target=\"_blank\">Drugaskan</a>, the Impenetrable Darkness</b> (Inverted Pandemonium)\u200b<br /> <b>The Burning Iron Spiral</b> (Inversion of the Primal Wilds)\u200b<br /> <b>The Deluge</b> (Inversion of the Aether)\u200b<br /> And the <b>Abyssal Arcana</b>\u200b:<br /> Doom (Fate)\u200b<br /> Regression (Time)\u200b<br /> Corruption (Matter)\u200b<br /> Entropy (Death)\u200b<br /> Isolation (Space)\u200b<br /> Dementia (Mind)\u200b<br /> Mutagen (Life)\u200b<br /> Subjugation (Spirit)\u200b<br /> Subluxation (Prime)\u200b<br /> Negation (Forces)\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27472,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27472-phoenix853457","user":"Phoenix853457","date":". 08-23-2023, 11:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27472-phoenix853457","name":"Phoenix853457","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27472_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-18T13:21:38-07:00","id":1518264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phoenix853457</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883338-the-other-five-paths-2e?p=1518261#post1518261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Existing Dur-Abzu:<br /> <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aos_S%C3%AD\" target=\"_blank\">Ao Si</a>, the Mound of Thorns</b>\u200b (Inversion of Arcadia)<br /> <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_Mesopotamian_underworld\" target=\"_blank\">Arallu</a>, the Cave of Rot and Tarnish</b> (Inversion of Stygia)\u200b<br /> <b><a href=\"https://books.google.com/books?id=N1EnBgAAQBAJ&amp;pg=PT169&amp;lpg=PT169&amp;dq=Drugaskan+(Zoroastrian)&amp;source=bl&amp;ots=Qd5xFk_i7Q&amp;sig=ACfU3U0Lvow1c_YFMr1JgTgPWymJt3iyZQ&amp;hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjG2Pn0va3rAhXGZs0KHfkPCSMQ6AEwEXoECAoQAQ#v=onepage&amp;q=Drugaskan%20(Zoroastrian)&amp;f=false\" target=\"_blank\">Drugaskan</a>, the Impenetrable Darkness</b> (Inverted Pandemonium)\u200b<br /> <b>The Burning Iron Spiral</b> (Inversion of the Primal Wilds)\u200b<br /> <b>The Deluge</b> (Inversion of the Aether)\u200b<br /> And the <b>Abyssal Arcana</b>\u200b:<br /> <i>Doom (Fate)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Regression (Time)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Corruption (Matter)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Entropy (Death)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Isolation (Space)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Dementia (Mind)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Mutagen (Life)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Subjugation (Spirit)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Subluxation (Prime)</i>\u200b<br /> <i>Negation (Forces)</i>\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>I like those Abyssal interpretations of the Arcana. Don't recall those from NHNA, though thematically they certainly fit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27301-shemihazazel","name":"shemihazazel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-18T16:54:45-07:00","id":1518276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shemihazazel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883338-the-other-five-paths-2e?p=1518264#post1518264\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I like those Abyssal interpretations of the Arcana. Don't recall those from NHNA, though thematically they certainly fit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking forward to what you come up with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-01T23:19:56-07:00","id":1550564,"title":"","content":"I have updated the write-ups to include most of the <b>Signs of Sorcery</b> material.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"